From dcb63695a6fbd7e3265547c4013741535c7d977f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FreeholdOS Build <build@freeholdos.local>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 13:41:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: let the Duress Unlock second credential be a
 password

The second credential now has the type of the screen lock: a PIN under a PIN
lock, a password under a password lock. The keyguard types the lock's own
type and SyntheticPasswordManager rejects a stored credential of another
type, so a decoy of another type would never open. The screens show the
matching input type and wording. When the lock type changes after the set-up,
the main screen says the second credential no longer works, and Change types
the current value as the type the decoy still has.
